{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd4a About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silent. Subtle. Psychological.<br>A refined battlefield of angels and demons awaits your mind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>GhosTrick</i> is a strategic board game where every piece hides its identity. Players control both angels and demons, engaging in a deep psychological duel. You\u2019ll deduce your opponent\u2019s intentions, bluff, and aim for one of three unique victory conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique fusion of hidden roles and strategic board gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Role-based abilities lead to mind games and deduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three layered victory conditions for dynamic play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match becomes a memorable narrative</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No explosions. No chaos. Just a quiet board filled with meaningful moves and tense decisions.<br>Win or lose, every game becomes a story worth telling. Experience the battle of minds in <i>GhosTrick</i>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830750?t=1757979321","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830750?t=1757979321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830750/d01b02582150855c7b89616dbb824b45c8fe8a6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757979321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830750/d01b02582150855c7b89616dbb824b45c8fe8a6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757979321","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Family Sharing","id